OL,12,G0232FAssignment
OL,13,     GIn Normandy, in north-west
OL,14,     GFrance, coastal erosion is a
OL,15,     Gserious and growing problem
OL,16,     Gbecause of rising sea levels. But
OL,17,     Gthere is a dispute about what to
OL,18,     Gdo about it.
