OL,4,G0306FOutlook
OL,5,     GAntony Penrose knew his mother
OL,6,     GLee Miller was a famous
OL,7,     Gphotographer, but she never
OL,8,     Gtalked about her experiences in
OL,9,     GWorld War Two. He didn't find out
OL,10,     Gwhy until after she died.
OL,11,G0350FWitness History
OL,12,     GThe box-office hit started a
OL,13,     Gtrend that took the animation
OL,14,     Gindustry away from traditional
OL,15,     Ghand-drawn cartoons and into
OL,16,     Gusing computer-generated images.
